354893_2123985974762689_1544591742969265917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eLfME6DFzLgQ7kNvwGTPb-u&_nc_oc=Adr_ChNNNw6rabAA9S5ee6lGPfDuhSilGpM8zBNLBM-TNss6rxmEZ1DFzCMvuwqY1iM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ1nqerGcpQvteFFEAuc4m-_kjD9SJc5phYcADmz2Qg2g&oe=6B0718E3"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1479678613042418", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300750_1479678616375751_6997581480530838541_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1JfpcxVZiIcQ7kNvwFms7o1&_nc_oc=AdrUSwA5vUKSw4bb7kqw2NIyGrKL7RoXTTJMmg4uQz6DGMb-HwY3aInjzzaJttgTe3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSsT8PPfKXaouReKAD2mnpTHHDBVVKJbpMZ81GYS90z5g&oe=6B0717F0"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "1245528793651676", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349371_1245528796985009_3447873084062975841_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QXLjnapRPTMQ7kNvwGwYUh7&_nc_oc=AdpA2yrhsGcdqr463mCWOJbC6AIYX-0Wi1sqf9N1T5b3cptjYJAoe8kr_J-Cpz2DgbE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTF1qA-EXL7_ymT0O1f_9eUaVTC3AP05n9nxiik0YP7Aw&oe=6B0716AD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hero360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely during a fire\u2014whether or not a smoke alarm is present. The name \u201cHERO\u201d reflects the purpose of the app: to empower users to become their own hero by learning life-saving reflexes and making the right decisions in a high-risk situation. Surviving a fire starts with knowledge and preparation\u2014HERO 360 gives users the chance to practice that before it\u2019s real.", "short_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely dur